        "custom_liquid": "<div style=\"max-width: 1500px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n<!-- Intro -->\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg,#020617 0%,#071a33 48%,#086ED3 100%); color: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px 24px; margin: 0 0 24px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8ec5ff; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Limited-Time Father’s Day Event</div>\n  <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff;\">Father’s Day Sale on Premium Golf Simulator Gear</h2>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 17px; color: #eff6ff; max-width: 900px;\">Give the golfer dad in your life the ultimate gift this Father’s Day. Shop limited-time savings on premium golf simulator packages, launch monitors, enclosures, projectors, hitting mats, impact screens, and simulator accessories from Elite Sim Golf.</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Quick highlights -->\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr)); gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 28px;\">\n  <div style=\"border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px; background: #ffffff;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #086ED3; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Save More</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #111827;\">Up to 20% Off</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563;\">Discounts vary by product and promotion.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px; background: #ffffff;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #086ED3; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Father’s Day Gifts</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #111827;\">Golf Simulators, Launch Monitors & More</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563;\">The ultimate gift for the golfer dad.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px; background: #ffffff;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #086ED3; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; margin-bottom: 6px;\">Why ESG</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #111827;\">Expert Support</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563;\">White Glove guidance before and after your purchase.</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Main content -->\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr)); gap: 18px; margin: 0 0 28px;\">\n\n  <div style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 18px; padding: 22px; background: #ffffff;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; color: #111827;\">Save on Complete Golf Simulator Packages</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 15px; color: #374151;\">Looking for the perfect Father’s Day gift? Our sale collection includes complete golf simulator packages that make it easy to bring year-round golf, practice, and entertainment into the home.</p>\n    <ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #374151; font-size: 15px;\">\n      <li>Launch monitors from trusted brands</li>\n      <li>Premium enclosures with impact screens</li>\n      <li>Short-throw and 4K projector options</li>\n      <li>Hitting mats, turf, and simulator accessories</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 18px; padding: 22px; background: #ffffff;\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; color: #111827;\">Build or Upgrade His Dream Setup</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 15px; color: #374151;\">Whether dad is building a simulator from the ground up or upgrading one key piece of his current setup, Elite Sim Golf has premium options for every space and skill level.</p>\n    <ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #374151; font-size: 15px;\">\n      <li>Turnkey SIMKIT packages</li>\n      <li>Custom setups with the SIMKIT Builder</li>\n      <li>Launch monitor upgrades</li>\n      <li>Projector, screen, mat, and accessory upgrades</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- Promo code box -->\n<div style=\"background: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px; margin: 0 0 28px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.2; color: #111827;\">Use Code DADSDAY at Checkout</h3>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 15px; color: #374151;\">Use coupon code <strong style=\"color:#086ED3;\">DADSDAY</strong> at checkout to unlock additional savings on eligible Father’s Day Sale products. Discounts vary by item, with select products discounted up to 20% off.</p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #374151;\">For the best deal, text <strong style=\"color:#111827; white-space:nowrap;\">865-248-2729</strong> and our team will help you find the right simulator setup for your space.</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Closing CTA -->\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px;\">\n  <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.2; color: #111827;\">Limited-Time Father’s Day Savings — Up to 20% Off</h3>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 15px; color: #374151;\">Discounts vary by product, with savings of up to 20% on select items. Due to manufacturer pricing policies, some brands may not display discounts directly, but special offers, package savings, and promotional pricing may still apply where permitted.</p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #374151;\">Shop the Father’s Day Sale now and give the golfer dad in your life the ultimate gift: a premium indoor golf experience from Elite Sim Golf.</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>",
